  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "P19l7wTW/DOARRDHGmQR4H/sgj0=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T14:39:05.079Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "The registry is not a bespoke artifact store \u2014 it is **Verdaccio**, the npm-compatible private registry, wrapped in Powerhouse-specific machinery. That choice is what makes `ph publish` / `ph install` / `ph unpublish` behave like npm commands while still being a closed ecosystem.\n\nWhat v6.0.0 added around Verdaccio is the interesting part:\n\n- **Renown JWT auth in front of Verdaccio** \u2014 identity comes from the Powerhouse identity layer, not from npm accounts.\n- **npm uplink** for transparent CDN fallback, so a package that resolves publicly still resolves through the private registry.\n- **SSE plus webhook publish notifications**, so subscribers learn about a publish rather than polling.\n- `ph unpublish` **purges the CDN cache** as part of unpublishing, which matters because the CDN is the read path.\n\nThe architectural payoff is the runtime-loading property: *Connect and Switchboard load processors and subgraphs at runtime from the HTTP registry \u2014 no rebuild required when new packages are published.* Two behaviours follow. Connect **auto-discovers** and offers to install the correct package when it meets an unknown document type, and a Connect **version picker** lets a user choose a specific dist-tag at install time. The registry URL itself is configuration, not a constant:\n\n```json\n// powerhouse.config.json\n{ \"registry\": \"https://your-registry-url\" }\n```\n\nwith `PH_REGISTRY_URL` taking precedence over the config file. `ph install` gained `--allow-build`, and prompts for a dist-tag when publishing a prerelease.\n\nThe reliability work is a hint about what the hard part was: concurrent tarball extraction had to be prevented, and correct package version resolution on the CDN had to be fixed.\n\nProvenance: academy `ReleaseNotes/v6.0.0.md` (\"Vetra Package Ecosystem\" highlight, \"Improvements\", \"Bug Fixes\") at academy 6.2.2-dev.45.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-13T14:39:04.000Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T14:39:05.079Z"
    }
  },
